elix's identities and gives 49.6% of hand-written lines (51.1% of src/). That is within 43-52%.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"C uses move tracking and ignores the rename commits, so Tobias gets no credit for help.zig. It shows help.zig credited to jnagpaul (166 lines), Dhole (75) and Bob Farrell (42), and Wen Li as owning only the small width.zig. It does not give exact percentages for Tobias or Wen Li.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"C says Felix at 49.6% is just under 50%, so the strict bus factor is 2 (Felix plus jnagpaul). It says jnagpaul's last commit was in 2023.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"C gives the loss as roughly Felix's 863 lines, about half. It gives no combined figure of about 85% that adds the lines already owned by departed authors.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"C names jnagpaul and Vincent as inactive but never mentions mochalins. It also calls Felix 'not active' by its 90-day test, which edges toward describing him as having left.\",\"pass\":false}]}","ttft_ms":14671,"type":"result","duration_ms":22524,"uuid":"b694e171-19a2-49ed-be31-210e0365acc8","ttft_stream_ms":1899,"time_to_request_ms":442,"first_content_frame_ms":1899,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
